---
import '../styles/cage.css';
import GoogleAnalytics from '../components/GoogleAnalytics.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <GoogleAnalytics />
  <title>网站统计与隐私 · Claude Cage</title>
  <link rel="canonical" href={new URL(`${base}privacy/`, Astro.site)} />
  <link rel="icon" href={`${base}cage-icon.png`} />
</head>
<body>
  <main class="wrap privacy-page">
    <a class="text-link" href={base}>← Claude Cage</a>
    <h1>网站统计与隐私</h1>
    <p>官网及使用文档使用 Google Analytics 4，统计活跃用户、页面访问量、访问来源，以及设备和语言等基本访问信息，用于改进网站内容。</p>
    <p>Google Analytics 使用第一方 Cookie 区分浏览器及访问会话。活跃用户数是统计估算，跨设备访问、浏览器限制和统计拦截会影响结果。</p>
    <p>我们配置的页面浏览记录中，页面地址只包含站点和路径，来源只包含来源站点。广告个性化与 Google Signals 已关闭。数据由 Google 处理，详情见 <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites?hl=zh-CN">Google 如何使用合作伙伴网站的信息</a>。</p>
    <p>你可以通过浏览器隐私设置限制 Cookie，或使用 <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout/">Google Analytics 停用插件</a>限制统计。</p>
    <section lang="en">
      <h2>Website analytics and privacy</h2>
      <p>This website and its documentation use Google Analytics 4 to measure active users, page views, referral sites, and basic device and language information. Google uses first-party cookies to distinguish browsers and sessions. User counts are estimates affected by multiple devices, browser restrictions, and blockers.</p>
      <p>Our page-view configuration sends the page origin and path, and the referring origin. Google Signals and advertising personalization are disabled. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites?hl=en">how Google uses information from partner sites</a>. You can restrict cookies in your browser or use the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout/">Google Analytics opt-out add-on</a>.</p>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
<style>
  .privacy-page { max-width: 820px; padding-block: 60px; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(30px, 6vw, 42px); margin-block: 35px 25px; }
  h2 { font-size: 25px; margin-top: 40px; }
  p { line-height: 1.85; }
  p a { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
</style>
